── SYNTAX ERROR ─────────────────────────── E0100_async_function.lt:1:1  [E0100]

Stilt has no `async fn`: a function that runs tasks has `async` in its row:

  1 │ async fn fetch(n: i64) -> i64 { n }
    │ ^^^^^

A function whose row holds `async` starts tasks or waits for them, as `fn f() ->
i64 / async`.

To fix it, delete `async`:

  1 │ async fn fetch(n: i64) -> i64 { n }
    │ ------
